  "body": "## What changed\n\nPR #2704 merged the earlier head of this PR (`39e6c84e8`). Thus the Do not touch protection is on `main` now, with the project format at v73.\n\nThis PR now holds only the changes that are not on `main`:\n\n- `crates/app/tests/continuous_4axis_part.rs`: the test `the_continuous_4axis_part_posts_its_wrapped_program` compares the saved project directly with the committed example. Main migrates the example through the reader first. That migration hides a stale committed example.\n- `docs/decisions/2055-do-not-touch.md`: the decision entry for that comparison.\n\n`git diff upstream/main` shows these two files only. No source file, fixture, NC golden, CL golden or PNG changes.\n\n## Conflict refresh\n\nHead: `51a8d34581b425b5dc057e8f3607841c7bbdd2a1`. It merges upstream main at `744c0847b04d54cfc6e3e8b24a21520c40b6bcef`.\n\nThe four conflicts take main's side:\n\n- `crates/app/tests/do_not_touch.rs`: main moved the persistence block into `do_not_touch_project.rs`. The test `protected_project_roundtrips_and_refuses_a_future_version` holds each check of the removed block. It also adds the `v72_reader_area` checks and an MCP refusal. The literal `73` assertion is dropped. `v72_reader_area(&raw) == Err(PROJECT_VERSION)` proves the same barrier.\n- `crates/app/src/project/apply.rs`: a comment. Main's text contains the text of this branch.\n- `crates/app/tests/model_link.rs`: main's v72 barrier assertion.\n- `crates/app/tests/sketch_project.rs`: main's v71 assertion. Only the message differs.\n\n## Validation\n\nAll results are for head `51a8d3458`, against base `744c0847b`.\n\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: GREEN. 1 step, 0 failed (`app continuous_4axis_part`).\n- `cargo xtask gate heavy --base upstream/main`: GREEN. 2 steps, 0 failed. Reached lane: `app heavy: continuous_4axis_part`. This suite has no ignored test, so the lane ran 0 tests (10 filtered out). The diff reaches no motion or sim heavy lane, because the sim and motion sources are equal to `main` now.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: GREEN.\n- App suites that the conflicts touched, in debug:\n  - `continuous_4axis_part`: 10 passed.\n  - `do_not_touch`: 3 passed.\n  - `do_not_touch_project`: 3 passed.\n  - `model_link`: 9 passed.\n  - `sketch_project`: 14 passed.\n- Mutation: example version changed from 73 to 72. `the_continuous_4axis_part_posts_its_wrapped_program` fails with `examples/first-continuous-4axis-part.camproj is stale; regenerate with WRITE_GOLDEN=1: /version: 73 != 72`. Restored: 10 passed.\n\nMain moved to `3970d3d03` after the gates. `git merge-tree` shows that this head merges with it without conflicts.\n\n## UI review evidence\n\nThe UI change is on `main` through #2704. The images stay on the images-only branch of the fork.\n\n| Before | After |\n| --- | --- |\n| ![Before: parent Boundary UI](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/37652ad68277c01babd8fb2996b41ed38e4cc7bd/2149/before.png) | ![After: protected rows, clearance, and viewport marks](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/37652ad68277c01babd8fb2996b41ed38e4cc7bd/2149/after.png) |\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe full release gate, the pixel snapshots and the interactive GUI were not run. The sim, motion and UI suites were not run again, because their sources are equal to `main`.\n\nProcess change: yes\nChangelog: none (the protection row shipped with #2704; this PR changes a test and a decision entry).\nFixes #2055\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
